<title>FINLAND: Finnish March export prices fall 6.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish March export prices fall 6.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 6.2 percent year-on-year in March and dropped 0.4 percent month-on-month, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated import prices rose 0.6 percent year-on-year in March and they fell 0.2 percent month-on-month, SF said.  </p>
<p>		 Mar 1997		Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     -0.4 pct		-0.5 pct	+0.6 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 -6.2 pct		-5.3 pct	+6.3 pct</p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>		 Mar 1997		Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     -0.2 pct		-0.2 pct	+0.9 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 +0.6 pct		+1.6 pct	+0.5 pct @</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
